    <!-- Hadith Section -->
    <div style="background: #E2DDD3; padding: 1.5rem; border-radius: 12px; margin-top: 2rem;">
        <h3 style="color: #1F4A3A;">📜 Hadith on Hajj</h3>
        <p>The Prophet (ﷺ) said: <em>"Whoever performs Hajj for the sake of Allah and does not commit any obscenity or transgression will return (free from sin) as the day his mother bore him."</em></p>
        <p style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">— Sahih al-Bukhari, Sahih Muslim</p>
